---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';

const seoTitle = "Couples & Trauma Therapy in St. Cloud, MN | Brian Oduguwa, LICSW";
const seoDescription = "Gottman & EFT couples counseling and EMDR/CPT trauma therapy for adults, veterans & first responders in St. Cloud and online across MN. Evening & Sat hours.";
---

<Layout title={seoTitle} description={seoDescription}>
  <Header />
  
  <main>
    <!-- HERO SECTION -->
    <section class="bg-slate-900 text-white py-20 px-6">
      <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto text-center space-y-6">
        <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-bold tracking-tight">Navigate Conflict. Deepen Connection. Heal What Hurts.</h1>
        <p class="text-xl text-slate-300 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
          Evidence-based couples therapy and specialized trauma recovery for adults, partners, veterans, and first responders in St. Cloud and via telehealth across Minnesota.
        </p>
        <p class="italic text-slate-400 text-sm">"The world is not beautiful; therefore, it is." — Kino no Tabi</p>
        
        <div class="bg-slate-800 p-8 rounded-lg shadow-lg text-left mt-8 text-slate-200">
          <p>Relationships and life transitions rarely follow a straight line. At Odyssey Insights Counseling LLC, I help couples and individuals break out of painful, repetitive cycles using structured, research-backed methods—including Gottman Method Couples Therapy, Emotionally Focused Therapy (EFT), EMDR, and Cognitive Processing Therapy (CPT). Whether you are working to rebuild trust after a betrayal, bridge emotional distance in your marriage, or process past trauma that keeps showing up in your present life, you don't have to figure it out alone.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row justify-center gap-4 mt-8">
          <a href="/scheduling" class="bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white font-semibold py-3 px-8 rounded transition">Book a Free 15-Minute Consultation</a>
          <a href="/scheduling" class="bg-slate-700 hover:bg-slate-600 text-white font-semibold py-3 px-8 rounded transition">Schedule an Intake Appointment</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- TRUST BANNER -->
    <div class="bg-slate-200 text-slate-800 text-sm font-semibold py-4 text-center px-4 shadow-inner">
      Brian Oduguwa, MSW, LICSW (MN License #22350) | 13+ Years Clinical Experience | Evening & Saturday Appointments Available | Serving St. Cloud, Central MN & Statewide via Secure Telehealth
    </div>

    <!-- IS THIS WHERE YOU ARE RIGHT NOW? -->
    <section class="py-20 px-6 max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-6">Is This Where You Are Right Now?</h2>
      <p class="mb-6 text-lg">Most couples and individuals reach out when trying harder on their own stops working:</p>
      <ul class="space-y-4 list-disc list-outside ml-6 text-slate-700">
        <li><strong>In Your Relationship:</strong> Conversations quickly escalate into the same exhausting arguments—or shut down into cold silence.</li>
        <li><strong>After Broken Trust:</strong> Infidelity, secrecy, or unspoken resentment has damaged your sense of emotional safety.</li>
        <li><strong>Growing Apart:</strong> Emotional distance has replaced closeness, leaving you feeling more like roommates than partners.</li>
        <li><strong>Out of Sync:</strong> You still care deeply about your partnership, but one partner feels more urgent about therapy than the other.</li>
        <li><strong>Carrying Heavy History:</strong> Unresolved trauma, military service, first-responder stress, or chronic anxiety makes it hard to stay present with the people you love.</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="mt-8 text-xl font-semibold text-slate-800 italic border-l-4 border-blue-600 pl-4">
        You are not broken. You are stuck in a protective pattern—and with the right clinical roadmap, patterns can change.
      </p>
    </section>
    
    <!-- Paste the remaining homepage sections (Active Therapy, Specialized Care, Bio Summary) here using similar HTML/Tailwind classes -->

  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>